// Title: Potential Persistence Via GlobalFlags
// Rule ID: 36803969-5421-41ec-b92f-8500f79c23b0
// Severity: high
// Tags: attack.privilege-escalation, attack.persistence, attack.defense-evasion, attack.t1546.012, car.2013-01-002
// Category: registry_set
// Product: windows
// Pipeline: azure_monitor
// Source: /home/user/Sigma_KQL/sigma_rules/rules/windows/registry/registry_set/registry_set_persistence_globalflags.yml
//
// Generated by sigma-to-kql converter
